      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I create two avatars that are almost identical, except one reproduces the issue and the other doesn’t.\n\nBelow are the IDs for both avatars. Both has only 3 triangles. The one that reproduces the issue has its mesh tilted by 10 degrees.\n\nNo Crash: `avtr_922e291a-7d13-48d7-af49-1f5e52c5eb98`\n\nCrash: `avtr_f8ea5364-662f-41bf-8a84-c2f5c01997a5`\n\nIf needed, I can provide a unitypackage that contains only assets with no copyright concerns.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
